{
  "id": "m3b-form-diagnostics-sparse",
  "description": "M3b owed cases for DefaultStrings.getInternal's per-axis missing-value, wrong-type and sparse-form diagnostics. Every language-form map here is DELIBERATELY INCOMPLETE, and each key isolates exactly one axis so the composed failure message identifies which arm fired. The two range keys separate the missing-range-END diagnostic (Range.Books, whose start is supplied and whose end is not) from the sparse-range-result diagnostic (Range.SparseResult, whose map carries only CARDINALITY_ONE while an en 1-1 range computes OTHER). Ordinal.Finish's map covers only ONE and TWO of en's four ordinal forms, so a value of 4 selects the absent OTHER. Loading only warns about incomplete form maps, which is what makes these states reachable at all.",
  "fallbackLocale": "en",
  "tiebreakers": null,
  "files": {
    "en": {
